# Petzval-type portrait objective, f ≈ 85 mm, maximum aperture ≈ f/2.
# Two cemented N-BK7/F2 achromats with the aperture stop between them. Wide open it shows
# the classic Petzval rendering (glowing spherical aberration, curved field); stopped down it
# sharpens. Cameras resize the stop with `f_number = N`.
name Petzval-type portrait objective 85 mm
units mm
S1       68.07      9.0     N-BK7    22.0
S2      -68.07      3.0     F2       22.0
S3    -1232.4      15.0     air      22.0
STO     inf        15.0     air      19.0   stop
S5       68.07      9.0     N-BK7    20.0
S6      -68.07      3.0     F2       20.0
S7    -1232.4      50.0     air      20.0
